<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ahmanson upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ahmanson upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz it upgraded H.F. Ahmanson and Co to buy from neutral, adding the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Cited the company's &quot;strong&quot; first quarter earnings.</p>
<p>-- Raised its 1997 earnings per share estimate to $3.25 from $3.15 and boosted 1998 view to $3.60 from $3.45.</p>
<p>-- Said that while the company's proposed hostile takeover of Great Western Financial Corp is still uncertain, Ahmanson remained attractive independent of the outcome.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/4 at 36-5/8.</p>
</text>
